            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Thirty Flights of Loving in this first-person short story. Encounter high-flying schemers, lovelorn criminals, and more stray kittens than you can shake a stick at. Saddle up, gunslinger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S INCLUDED</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thirty Flights of Loving</strong>, a 20-minute first-person short story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Bone</strong>, a 20-minute prequel to Thirty Flights of Loving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer commentary for Thirty Flights of Loving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an original soundtrack by Chris Remo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/214700/extras/61079da66523ff079694a012a88130a0.avif?t=1781207199\" width=126 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECOGNITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Independent Games Festival <strong>Excellence in Narrative award</strong> (nominee)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Independent Games Festival <strong>Seumas McNally Grand Prize</strong> (honorable mention)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Independent Games Festival <strong>Nuovo Award</strong> (honorable mention)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Featured in New York's <strong>Museum of the Moving Image </strong>and Seattle's<strong> EMP Museum</strong></p>",
